Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.18,0:00:18.92,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}She'll get the honors because she earned them.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N荣誉属于她 这是她赢来的
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.94,0:00:22.68,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}She'll receive praise of which she is most deserving.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N她将收获当之无愧的赞美
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.39,0:00:27.58,TL,,0,0,0,,{\fs78}3{\fs68}年前 她的世界排名跌到第{\fs78}532{\fs68}位
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.58,0:00:28.31,TL,,0,0,0,,这一次
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.31,0:00:31.33,TL,,0,0,0,,她捧起了武汉{\fs78}1000{\fs68}赛的冠军
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.59,0:00:33.43,TL,,0,0,0,,她的武器
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.43,0:00:35.66,TL,,0,0,0,,是被很多人看不上的月亮球
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.66,0:00:38.53,TL,,0,0,0,,高弧线 大上旋 落点压得极深
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.53,0:00:41.04,TL,,0,0,0,,再掺上小球换节奏
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.79,0:00:44.63,TL,,0,0,0,,武汉半决赛打斯瓦泰克
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.63,0:00:46.70,TL,,0,0,0,,对手轰出{\fs78}37{\fs68}个制胜分
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.70,0:00:48.78,TL,,0,0,0,,她全场只失误{\fs78}7{\fs68}次
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.78,0:00:50.53,TL,,0,0,0,,她从不跟你拼谁打得重
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.53,0:00:52.87,TL,,0,0,0,,她拼谁先失去耐心
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.42,0:00:57.90,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}To lead 5-1 in the second set.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N第二盘 她 {\fs78}5{\fs68} 比 {\fs78}1{\fs68} 领先
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.54,0:01:01.04,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}Like a dream, honestly.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N老实说 像做梦一样
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.40,0:01:02.74,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}I don't know what's going on.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N我都不知道发生了什么
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.30,0:01:05.24,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}I'm just…{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N我只是
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.48,0:01:09.09,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}Yeah, I don't know what to say.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N我不知道该说什么
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.12,0:01:10.84,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}I'm sorry, I'm just very happy.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N抱歉 我就是太开心了
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.19,0:01:14.76,TL,,0,0,0,,从{\fs78}532{\fs68} 到{\fs78}11{\fs68} 她用了{\fs78}3{\fs68}年
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.76,0:01:16.86,TL,,0,0,0,,你不必比所有人都有力量
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.86,0:01:19.80,TL,,0,0,0,,你只需要比所有人 多打回去一拍
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.80,0:01:21.71,TL,,0,0,0,,离世界前{\fs78}10{\fs68}只差一步
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.71,0:01:23.55,TL,,0,0,0,,她会迈过去吗？
